  "finding": "The exact reported Catastrophic failure / Window creation request failed is isolated to CreateCoreWebView2CompositionControllerAsync itself, reproduced both through the WPF composition control and directly with the validated top-level HWND. Environment creation, profile write, visible STA HWND and standard WPF/raw controller creation succeed.",
